+- `hedge_short_score`
+- `hedge_long_exposure_scale`
+- `hedge_short_exposure_scale`
+- `hedge_confidence`
+- `hedge_risk_scale`
+- `hedge_allow_new_risk`
+- nullable target fields / regime / reason / model version
+
+HPRL shadow env 不拥有正式成交、手续费、funding、钱包余额、强平或最终 PnL。
